{
 "schema_version": "value.golden-zones/v1",
 "notes": [
  "Zones per decision Q12. trajectory: dispatch, flows, prices, SoC, capacity, investment proposals (frozen in the doctoral family). accounting: residuals, adjustments, audit tables, cost and income ledgers, validation and attribution reports (revisable under a universal correction id). identity: code, module and context identity hashes and versions, which change with any code edit and are governed by method identity and docs/release/VERSION_LEDGER.json; reported but never gated.",
  "Rules are fnmatch patterns on '<artifact>::<column>'; the first match wins; unmatched columns are trajectory.",
  "Pre-registered accounting rules (A2 stress events, Q7 node boundary) cover outputs that P0-4/P0-6 add to both profiles. Any other purely added accounting column gets its zone rule in the same commit that adds it, citing the decision id. A column's zone is pinned by the first golden revision that records it and can only become stricter (gridform_validation.golden.pinned_zones), so existing trajectory columns are immovable."
 ],
